{%- comment -%}
BSO Shortcode Render
--------------------
This snippet renders shortcodes based on the provided code and values.
Template version: 1.0.2
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
This snippet is needed because the new render tag does not support dynamic snippet names as variables.
You need to add every shortcode here manually.
Example: {%- render 'shortcode-render', code: 'product', values: [product_handle]-%}
This snippet is to be rendered only from shortcode.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- case code -%}
  {%- when 'product' -%}
    {%- render 'shortcode-product', values: values, keys: keys -%}
  {%- when 'article' -%}
    {%- render 'shortcode-article', values: values, keys: keys -%}
  {%- when 'summary' -%}
    {%- render 'shortcode-summary', values: values, keys: keys -%}
  {%- when 'feature-product' -%}
    {%- render 'shortcode-feature-product', values: values, keys: keys -%}
  {%- when 'collection' -%}
    {%- render 'shortcode-collection', values: values, keys: keys -%}
  {%- when 'cta' -%}
    {%- render 'shortcode-cta', values: values, keys: keys -%}
  {%- when 'content_grid' -%}
    {%- render 'shortcode-content-grid', values: values, keys: keys -%}
  {%- when 'cta-gallery' -%}
    {%- render 'shortcode-gallery', values: values, keys: keys -%}
  {%- else -%}
    Liquid error: The given shortcode ({{ code }}) does not exist in the list of legal shortcodes. If the snippet exists you need to manually add it to shortcode-render.liquid.
{%- endcase -%}